⎕TRAP←(0 'E' '⎕←⎕DM ⋄ ⎕OFF 1')
⎕IO←0
{}⎕FIX 'file://src/ImageOps.dyalog'
mask←9 11⍴0
mask[2+⍳5;3+⍳5]←1
picture←30+190×mask
⎕←'A small shape:' ⋄ ⎕←mask
⎕←'Gaussian blur:' ⋄ ⎕←(1 1 'clamp') ImageOps.BlurPlane picture
⎕←'Median:' ⋄ ⎕←(1 'clamp') ImageOps.Median picture
⎕←'Opening:' ⋄ ⎕←('open' 'square') ImageOps.Morphology mask
regions←4 ImageOps.Components mask
⎕←'Region areas:' ⋄ ⎕←regions.areas
edges←(1 1 35 100) ImageOps.Canny picture
⎕←'Canny edges:' ⋄ ⎕←edges.edges
smaller←(2 'vertical') ImageOps.Carve picture
⎕←'Carved shape:' ⋄ ⎕←⍴smaller.output
⎕OFF 0
